{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The protagonist who has lost her memory is trapped in a five-day loop. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Together with Ouro, travel through a world with strange time changes, escape the loop through exploration and battle, change her fate, and learn the truth!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/hr2_cn.png?t=1750328899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn [Boss] into [Elf]! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the in-game boss to get exclusive elves! Cultivate elves and evolve into combat power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/GIF_2025-5-28_15-54-42.gif?t=1750328899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multi-purpose, use your [imagination]!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pufferfish, boxes, suction pots......  Combat, decryption, skip all-round adaptation, multi-purpose unlocks multiple ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/GIF_2025-5-28_15-59-35.gif?t=1750328899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Ultra-High Speed\u3011Exciting battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the easy-to-use Ouro rapid dash, combine Ouro skills and Attack, and react as fast as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059210/extras/GIF_2025-5-28_15-48-49.gif?t=1750328899\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special [Time]!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add time to map spaces! [Time] is a special resource! In the 5 days of the loop, explore and open up a new world line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar